                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4417: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-06-06T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6, 1922—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>141. Your 245 June 3, 7 P.M.</p>
                <p>Your telegrams of May 26 and June 3, 2 P.M. to Mukden are approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
